This branch is I used forked OpenRails source code to create. Its purpose is to improve my multiplayer mode in my own route. Now player must choose the activity from a Form after they start or join the game. It will be more convenient.
But it just design for my own route. If you want to let it work in your route, you need to modify the ActivitySelect's Form1, change the .act filename to your own file. But you need this file put in your route folder's sub folder "Activities" sub folder.
private void button1_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
        {
            TrySetActivityFromButton("T236任务.act");
        }

        private void button2_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
        {
